<description>&lt;p&gt;Hezbollah’s chief is demanding Lebanon free five detained operatives while rejecting any post-UNIFIL force outside U.N. authority, and he asserts that Hezbollah does not work for Iran but that Iran works for Hezbollah. Israeli warplanes are flying intensively at low altitude over southern Lebanon and the Nabatieh region, and Israel is opposing French troop deployment in south Lebanon after the UNIFIL exit. US sanctions on Hezbollah affiliates are reported to have limited impact, and Iran is reported to be developing chemical weapons. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPN1AtRDNCZ1RzMGFIcTdpSXU3U3MyZkFWOWFEdVpJcXBzb2ljM0dOMjNELUpXOEwzMFVoWFNaaXNybFVldTZ1cHkzUWhjZ1VFNXVKOE1tQ01POWpSN1owYVhnNTRQRnRORUdCUTVpTVpEUG9NLU1NVHFNYVhOUFIxdU1vR0tLeWtrQTBCSTY5VWZoV0VaTDR3ZFFidXI1MTBTYmp4R0ZHTnJMeUk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxORXc3TElhdHlmNHBCbEVqbVo4Tk9LZ3RaSXpjQ0tiQzllQWJXXzViTDF3cVYzLWFBM0NpQTFLclZxWDhXTlYzMFd3enJzRzNERjNCZkRNZDZFQ0hCbzhSNUhwS3Z6ejBoNFFaZHpSLTVCT1RhTV9PdHVsUW5lT2pieXdkNnAyRkp0SUdPdXFzUnp3VW8tX25mdnota2szbzR5Wm9rLXVjQ2pDZTUwcWRsSWd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNdTRZMXhKOUlNZWstR0RnZnJoNVU2b1EyLTdSV2htSEdFQWNTRF8zNE5kTHVHZ2ZYM2JvclZaeFhfaFZTVGNHWnQ4QzhlaTAtSHR2YkNudnZXRlU3X0xENllfTnVsOFNyYjRZLTFzQXpwa0YwNnkzWVU4SEE5QWhlZzZSM3hOWDIwV1VYWi1wS3JLLXVOMFdpaVJHUWlKUUI4Nmhvc0xsRXNfWDZPdUpNSnpaWERVS3pTU2JsRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Algemeiner.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.c